           <h2 class="post-title">A Reminder Of Our Values</h2>
              <div class="post-content clearfix">
    	       <p><a href="http://blogger.forgottenskies.com/" target="_blank">Steve Gentile</a> recently had a thinking out loud moment by posting the Agile Manifest as a reminder to himself of what he values.&#160; It’s really important to constantly put these types of reminders in front of ourselves as we work in environments that don’t necessarily breed best practices.&#160; The contractual obligations of the business world definitely don’t lend to “welcoming change.”&#160; Often our focus on “getting paid” blinds us to the goal of “continuous delivery of valuable software.”</p>
<p>It is a test of our dedication that we continually reassess our values and attempt to embed them more deeply in our daily activities..</p>
              </div>
